  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>（Zeefski 史莱姆整合包）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>本整合包是我在<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">100天生存视频</span>中使用的（现已更新至 1.21.1），基本上是基于《转生史莱姆》模组构建的版本。&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">《转生史莱姆》（Tensura Reincarnated）</span>是核心模组，其余所有模组均用于补充、提升并丰富史莱姆游戏体验。这些模组让游玩更加便捷，增添了诸多值得探索的新奇内容，助你获得最佳的游戏体验。希望你喜欢它，就像我们一样！！ :)</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">- <span style=\"color:#3598db\">自定义 FTBQuests，提供更多获取独特技能的方法</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;- <span style=\"color:#3598db\">TR: Mysticism，提供额外种族 + 独特技能</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;- <span style=\"color:#3598db\">Reroll Datapack，重生时可重新抽取独特技能（共 5 次机会）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;- <em><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Boss Structures，确保生成 Boss</span></strong></em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp;- Skill Wiki，提供游戏内准确的技能信息</span></strong></em></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Gravestone，方便拾取掉落物且永不消失。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">EMI，可查看全部配方，让你永远不会卡关。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>- <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Xaero's World Map，提供俯瞰周围环境的地图视图。</span></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Ice and Fire，添加了龙及其他神话生物可供击杀或驯服。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">大量优化与生活品质类模组，全面提升性能与游玩体验</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>以及更多惊喜！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>我的视频：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lAXJy1eLeEc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1510981789886447698/1511850906428375060/BloomHostBanner_Base.gif?ex=6a3a5820&is=6a3906a0&hm=08837e12226cf2dd61979022b1b0248a705f70410e64fa2cd5fe86bd6c6b8fa5&=\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>如果你需要搭建自己的服务器，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>并使用兑换码 Zeefski，首月可享 85 折优惠！</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>模组列表：</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clientsort\" rel=\"nofollow\">客户端排序 (作者: NotRyken)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm (作者: BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ferritecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore ((Neo)Forge) (作者: malte0811)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS (作者: LatvianModder)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jeremyseq-damage-indicator\" rel=\"nofollow\">JeremySeq 伤害指示器 (作者: JeremySeq)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔描述 (作者: DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architec